# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are documented here, following
[Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/) and
[Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

**The `[Unreleased]` section is generated.** Add a bullet by creating a file
under `changelog.d/<category>/`, then run `make registry-generate`:

```bash
python3 scripts/registry_tool.py new --registry changelog --category added \
  --title "Export endpoint for the account ledger (#1234)"
```

Released sections below are written once by `registry_tool.py release` and are
immutable afterwards — errata go under a new `[Unreleased]` bullet, never by
editing history.

